            Turning Communication Theory into Hardware
        </h1>
        <p data-i18n="research-hero-desc">
            Developing wireless, optical, and high-speed digital communication systems from theoretical mathematical models and simulations to validated physical prototypes on FPGA and laboratory testbeds at RMUTI Khon Kaen Campus.
